    "slug": "gigafaunic",
    "description": "<p>The user’s Base HP increases by +30% (min 10, max 40), their SPD is cut by 15%, their other Stats increase by 10%, and Actions targeting the user have +9 Accuracy.</p><p>Attacks from non-allied creatures that are at least 2 Size Categories smaller than the user deal have -1 CRIT and -15% EHR. The user's Attacks targeting these creatures deal 10% more damage and their @Trait[contact] Attacks targeting these creatures gain @Trait[crushing].</p>",
